   "P1",
   "Title: Zassenhaus Lemma/Lemma 2"
  ],
  [
   "P2",
   "Let $G$ be a [[Definition:Group|group]] whose [[Definition:Identity Element|identity]] is $e$."
  ],
  [
   "P3",
   "Let $H_1, H_2$ be [[Definition:Subgroup|subgroups]] of $G$."
  ],
  [
   "P4",
   "Let:"
  ],
  [
   "P5",
   "{{begin-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   "P6",
   "{{eqn | l = N_1"
  ],
  [
   "P7",
   "      | o = \\lhd"
  ],
  [
   "P8",
   "      | r = H_1"
  ],
  [
   "P9",
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   "P10",
   "{{eqn | l = N_2"
  ],
  [
   "P11",
   "      | o = \\lhd"
  ],
  [
   "P12",
   "      | r = H_2"
  ],
  [
   "P13",
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   "P14",
   "{{end-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   "P15",
   "where $\\lhd$ denotes the relation of being a [[Definition:Normal Subgroup|normal subgroup]]."
  ],
  [
   "P16",
   "Then:"
  ],
  [
   "P17",
   ":$\\paren {H_1 \\cap N_2} \\paren {H_2 \\cap N_1} \\lhd \\paren {H_1 \\cap H_2}$"
  ],
  [
   1,
   "Consider arbitrary $x_h \\in H_1 \\cap H_2$."
  ],
  [
   2,
   ""
  ],
  [
   3,
   "By definition of [[Definition:Set Intersection|set intersection]], it follows that:"
  ],
  [
   4,
   ":$x_h \\in H_1 \\land x_h \\in H_2$"
  ],
  [
   5,
   ""
  ],
  [
   6,
   "We aim to show that:"
  ],
  [
   7,
   ":$x_h \\paren {H_1 \\cap N_2} \\paren {H_2 \\cap N_1} x_h^{-1} = \\paren {H_1 \\cap N_2} \\paren {H_2 \\cap N_1}$"
  ],
  [
   8,
   ""
  ],
  [
   9,
   "thus demonstrating:"
  ],
  [
   10,
   ":$\\paren {H_1 \\cap N_2} \\paren {H_2 \\cap N_1} \\lhd \\paren {H_1 \\cap H_2}$ "
  ],
  [
   11,
   "by the [[Normal Subgroup Test]]."
  ],
  [
   12,
   ""
  ],
  [
   13,
   "First note that from [[Intersection with Normal Subgroup is Normal]]:"
  ],
  [
   14,
   ""
  ],
  [
   15,
   ":$H_1 \\cap N_2 \\lhd H_1$"
  ],
  [
   16,
   ":$H_2 \\cap N_1 \\lhd H_2$"
  ],
  [
   17,
   ""
  ],
  [
   18,
   "We have:"
  ],
  [
   19,
   ""
  ],
  [
   20,
   "{{begin-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   21,
   "{{eqn | l = x_h \\paren {H_1 \\cap N_2} \\paren {H_2 \\cap N_1} x_h^{-1}"
  ],
  [
   22,
   "      | r = x_h \\paren {H_1 \\cap N_2} {x_h}^{-1} x_h \\paren {H_2 \\cap N_1} x_h^{-1}"
  ],
  [
   23,
   "      | c = "
  ],
  [
   24,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   25,
   "{{eqn | r = x_h \\paren {H_1 \\cap N_2} \\paren { {x_h}^{-1} x_h} \\paren {H_2 \\cap N_1} x_h^{-1}"
  ],
  [
   26,
   "      | c = {{Group-axiom|1}}"
  ],
  [
   27,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   28,
   "{{eqn | r = x_h \\paren {H_1 \\cap N_2} e \\paren {H_2 \\cap N_1} x_h^{-1}"
  ],
  [
   29,
   "      | c = {{Defof|Inverse Element}}"
  ],
  [
   30,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   31,
   "{{eqn | r = x_h \\paren {H_1 \\cap N_2} \\paren {H_2 \\cap N_1} x_h^{-1}"
  ],
  [
   32,
   "      | c = {{Defof|Identity Element}}"
  ],
  [
   33,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   34,
   "{{eqn | r = \\paren {H_1 \\cap N_2} x_h \\paren {H_2 \\cap N_1} x_h^{-1}"
  ],
